arm.\n\n**Subject:**\nThe central figure is a beautiful young woman with long, flowing dark brown hair that cascades over her shoulders. Her hair has a glossy sheen, with subtle highlights and shadows suggesting depth and movement, as if caught in soft light. A few strands frame her face, adding to the natural, intimate feel of the portrait.\n\nHer facial features are delicate and symmetrical. She has large, expressive eyes with long, defined lashes and a warm, inviting gaze. Her eyebrows are softly arched, complementing her gentle smile. Her skin is flawless and porcelain-like, with a subtle blush on her cheeks that enhances her radiant expression. She is smiling broadly, revealing a set of perfectly white, evenly spaced teeth, which conveys genuine happiness and approachability.\n\nShe wears a small, elegant diamond-shaped drop earring in her left ear, which catches the light and adds a touch of sophistication. Her right hand is gently resting near her chin, with fingers slightly curled, suggesting a pose of thoughtfulness or playful flirtation. Her left hand is partially visible, holding a strand of her hair or perhaps a small object, adding a sense of motion and grace to the composition.\n\n**Attire:**\nShe is dressed in a black, sleeveless top or dress with a deep V-neckline, which accentuates her collarbone and décolletage. The fabric appears smooth and slightly reflective, catching the ambient light. Over this, she wears a loose-fitting, long-sleeved white garment, possibly a shirt or robe, which is draped casually over her shoulders. The contrast between the sleek black and the soft white creates a visually striking and balanced look.\n\n**Setting & Lighting:**\nThe background is softly blurred and luminous, with warm, diffused lighting that suggests an indoor setting, perhaps a room with large windows or ambient evening glow. Subtle bokeh effects—soft, out-of-focus circles of light—dot the background, enhancing the dreamy, ethereal atmosphere. The lighting 